# Configuration

Use this file as a template for local settings or example configuration values.

```ini
[Settings]
BusinessName = GlassHeroes Business
Version = 0.3.3.0
ManagerEnabled = true
OrdersEnabled = true
PaletteEnabled = true
DebugMode = false
```

Notes:
- Rename this file if needed for your actual script settings.
- Keep local secrets or machine-specific values out of Git if they are not meant to be shared.
